# Fondue Monorepo Agents Guide

## Structure

- `builder/` — Fromager wheel building system
- `rhai-pipeline/` — Production package index / onboarding collections

## Onboarding safety

- Build packages from source unless explicit legal and Product Security
  approvals authorize a pre-built wheel.
- If no compliant source repository, archive, or approved mirror exists,
  remove any partial changes and stop with a clean tree and no commits.
- Never create `pre_built: true` during automated onboarding.

## Linting

Run `make linter` before committing. Fix all errors.
